    "media_with_text_x893e7": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_6Dj3ML": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Quality and Service You Can Trust",
            "heading_size": "md"
          }
        },
        "text_3yaURL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Behind the scenes, we’re guided by a leader whose 30 years of international procurement experience helps us build strong relationships with manufacturers worldwide and ensure our customers receive only the best. </p><p>But FIMIC is more than just a business—we partner with every dealer, distributor, and customer we serve. While we’re proud to offer highly competitive pricing, we take just as much pride in seamless service. When you order from us, expect your products to ship the next day with real-time delivery updates—that way, you’re always in the loop. </p><p>As a local business, it means a great deal to us to offer personalized service while continuously expanding our network of trusted dealers and distributors. We are committed to providing unbeatable prices, delivered with unparalleled customer service—that’s what you can count on.</p>",
            "text_size": "md"
          }
        }
